    bench_vulkan_8k_rss_kb_reports_zero_strict_jit_2026-11-28, 0, "rss_kb() in test/05_perf/graphics_2d/bench_vulkan_8k_retained_damage.spl prints rss_kb=0 in the VULKAN_8K_RETAINED timing receipt under SIMPLE_JIT_STRICT=1, while /usr/bin/time -v reports max RSS 1125568-1205296 KiB for the same run. The receipt line carries a false value. Root cause not investigated: candidates are rt_file_read_text(/proc/self/status) returning None under JIT, text.find, or char comparison on text indexing."

